/**
 * Role-to-role transferability scores — Phase 2 of the matching graph.
 *
 * Generated by scripts/generate-transferability.ts via Jaccard similarity
 * over the O*NET-derived skill sets in lib/taxonomy.ts. Within-industry
 * pairs use MIN_SCORE=0.15; cross-industry uses 0.3.
 *
 * Used by /api/jobs/match: when a job's required skills aren't a perfect
 * match, surface the transferability score from the user's nearest
 * matched role so we can show "75% of the way there" instead of hiding
 * the job entirely.
 */

